OL,3,GNEWSANo windows and steel doors - life
OL,4,Aat NI's 'most-attacked Orange hall'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrangemen whose hall has been targeted
OL,7,Fdozens of times in sectarian attacks
OL,8,Fsay the fear and intimidation has
OL,9,Fdamaged their community and left them
OL,10,Funable to properly celebrate their
OL,11,Fheritage and culture.
OL,13,FRasharkin Chosen Few Orange lodge
OL,14,Fbelieves its hall is "the most-attacked
OL,15,FOrange hall in Northern Ireland" and
OL,16,Fsays there have been 51 incidents in 30
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
