OL,3,GNEWSANo windows and steel doors - life
OL,4,Aat NI's 'most-attacked Orange hall'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice recorded 17 hate crimes in the
OL,7,Fpast year against Orange and Apprentice
OL,8,FBoys' halls across Northern Ireland -
OL,9,Fan increase on the previous two years
OL,10,Fand the second highest in five years.
OL,12,FRasharkin Orangemen say they have lost
OL,13,Fconfidence in police, particularly
OL,14,Fafter CCTV showed a patrol car driving
OL,15,Fover freshly-painted graffiti.
